    <DataNode elementId="AT3G61530-MONOMER" textLabel="AT3G61530-MONOMER" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="AT3G61530.1" dataSource="TAIR gene name" />
      <Graphics centerX="600" centerY="455" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana PANB2&lt;/i&gt; gene was shown to complement the &lt;i&gt;E. coli panB&lt;/i&gt; mutant Hfr3000 YA139 (deficient in ketopantoate hydroxymethyltransferase) as effectively as the wildtype &lt;i&gt;E. coli panB&lt;/i&gt; gene |CITS:[14675432]|.</Comment>
